<title>USA: Central and Southern names CFO.</title>
<headline>Central and Southern names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MILLEDGEVILLE, Ga. 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Central and Southern Holding Co said its board of directors named Michael Ricketson as executive vice president and chief financial officer of the company.</p>
<p>Ricketson was also elected to the company's board of directors.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
